2641:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Sensing.c **** *           mode parameters can take the following values:
2642:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Sensing.c **** *           CapSense_CLK_SOURCE_DIRECT The spreadspectrum is not used.
